    "Only affects future hrdrhrdrhrdr launches. Keeps agents from using competing browser tools; does not change global CLI settings. Pi isn't covered: Pi agents keep all of their MCP servers." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only affects future hrdrhrdrhrdr launches. Keeps agents from using competing browser tools; does not change global CLI settings. Pi isn't covered: Pi agents keep all of their MCP servers."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今後 hrdrhrdrhrdr から起動するセッションだけに適用します。他のブラウザツールの使用を抑止し、グローバルな CLI 設定は変更しません。Pi には適用されず、Pi エージェントはすべての MCP サーバーをそのまま使います。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "앞으로 hrdrhrdrhrdr에서 실행할 세션에만 적용합니다. 다른 브라우저 도구 사용을 막으며 전역 CLI 설정은 변경하지 않습니다. Pi에는 적용되지 않으며, Pi 에이전트는 모든 MCP 서버를 그대로 사용합니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only authentication method, paths and account/server metadata are saved. Passwords, tokens and sessions stay transient; the selected vendor context may be read or written by its CLI." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only authentication method, paths and account/server metadata are saved. Passwords, tokens and sessions stay transient; the selected vendor context may be read or written by its CLI."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "認証方法・パス・アカウント／サーバー情報だけを保存します。パスワード・トークン・セッションは一時保持のみです。選択した設定は提供元の CLI が読み書きする場合があります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "인증 방식·경로·계정/서버 정보만 저장합니다. 비밀번호·토큰·세션은 일시적으로만 유지하며, 선택한 설정은 Provider CLI가 읽거나 쓸 수 있습니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only PNG, JPEG, GIF, and WebP images can be attached to panes on another machine." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only PNG, JPEG, GIF, and WebP images can be attached to panes on another machine."
